# The CLI does not read .gitignore, so a `vercel deploy` from this directory
# would try to upload the raw photo and video folders — nearly a gigabyte of
# source material the site never serves. Git deployments never see these
# (they're git-ignored), so this file exists purely to protect CLI deploys.
BABES NET PICS WEBSITE/
new website assets/
_tmp/
NOTES.private.md
.agents/
skills-lock.json
